@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Conceptual multi-region / zone alternative — not selected or funded
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

cloud "Routing / promotion authority\nMechanism pending" as ROUTE
rectangle "Region A (abstract)" {
 node "Failure zone A1\nActive trusted app candidate" as A
 node "Failure zone A2\nOptional redundant capacity" as A2 #164E63
 A ..> A2 : consistency / fencing design required
}
rectangle "Region B (abstract)" {
 node "Failure zone B1\nOptional recovery / standby target" as B #164E63
 node "Failure zone B2\nOptional additional capacity" as B2 #164E63
}
ROUTE --> A : current-writer candidate
ROUTE ..> B : only after guarded promotion
A ..> B : evaluated copy / replication, not an assumed facility
legend bottom
 Region/zone labels are conceptual failure domains, not actual provider locations or certified AZ features.
 Independent capacity, store consistency, writer fencing, keys, routing and operating cost need evidence.
 Replication alone is not backup; no automatic failover, zero loss or availability objective is promised.
endlegend
@enduml
